	(text "DEV PORT, page 3 of 3: RP2040 + W25Q16 on hub port DN4, running the STOCK ADSBee 1421 Programmer\n(RP2040-Zero pin-out: GPIO26 ~SRST, 27 SYNC, 28 TX, 29 RX, 16 WS2812 status). The m1421 lines go through\nDev-powered 74LVC1G125s into the target's LVC logic (no back-powering). Remove R1808/R1809 for a console-only\nport. Spare GPIOs on J1801 (holes = test points); R1812/R1813 (DNP) put I2C0 on the board I2C bus.\nJ1802 SWD (SWCLK, GND, SWDIO as on the Pico) for the Raspberry Pi Debug Probe; RUN on TP1803."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 266.7 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "e8c085e2-7817-49ae-83a5-177c1b6a4ac9")
	)
